<Card>
  <Title>Photosynthesis</Title>
  <Text>Plants turn sunlight, water and air into the sugar they live on, and give out oxygen.</Text>
  <Text strong>Sunlight + water + CO₂ → sugar + oxygen</Text>
  <Text secondary>Happens mostly in the leaves, inside tiny parts called chloroplasts.</Text>
  <Text status="good">You got this one right last time.</Text>
</Card>
